# Disable ALL line-ending conversion.
#
# results/data_summary.json records the SHA-256 of trainingData.csv and
# validationData.csv, and the report states that neither file was modified.
# If git normalised their line endings on checkout, a clone would hold files
# whose digests no longer match what the audit certifies. Treating every path
# as binary-safe keeps that guarantee intact for anyone who clones the repo.
* -text

# Keep the generated Office documents and figures out of textual diffs.
*.docx  binary
*.pptx  binary
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.zip   binary
*.gz    binary
